+	depends on DRM_MIPI_DSI
+	depends on BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
+	help
+	  Say Y here if you want to enable support for the FocalTech FT8716
+	  TDDI-based 1080x1920 video mode DSI panels (including the Sharp
+	  module variant) found in the Smartisan ODIN (U2 Pro) smartphone.
+
+config DRM_PANEL_SMARTISAN_NT36672
+	tristate "Smartisan ODIN Novatek NT36672 1080p MIPI-DSI panel"
